  "html": "<p>These names still exist. If you already have one, it still works. They do not drop anymore. Later names sit on those slots now.</p>\n<p>The shared pile is on <a href=\"/wiki/Rainbow_Level_Bands\" title=\"Rainbow Level Bands\">Rainbow Level Bands</a>. Named lair-chest pieces are on <a href=\"/wiki/Boss_Lair_Rainbows\" title=\"Boss Lair Rainbows\">Boss Lair Rainbows</a>. Names that only come from the Well are on <a href=\"/wiki/Well-Only_Rainbows\" title=\"Well-Only Rainbows\">Well-Only Rainbows</a>.</p>\n<table class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" summary=\"Contents\"><tr><td><div id=\"toctitle\"><h2>Contents</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Old_splint_set\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Old splint set</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Old_plate\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Old plate</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Old_shields\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Old shields</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Old_amulets\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Old amulets</span></a></li>\n</ul></td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Old_splint_set\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Old splint set</span></h2>\n<p>The handcrafted splint names were pulled. Copies that already dropped still work.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cooper's_Cooler_Splint\" title=\"Cooper's Cooler Splint\">Cooper's Cooler Splint</a> — body. Later names on that slot are <a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Miramba\" title=\"Bone Miramba\">Bone Miramba</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Nacho's_Conquistador_Cuirass\" title=\"Nacho's Conquistador Cuirass\">Nacho's Conquistador Cuirass</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Santoro's_Vise\" title=\"Santoro's Vise\">Santoro's Vise</a> — helm.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ultimate_Rush\" title=\"Ultimate Rush\">Ultimate Rush</a> — gloves.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Homo_Erectus_Stirrups\" title=\"Homo Erectus Stirrups\">Homo Erectus Stirrups</a> — boots.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Rigid_Milwaukee_Brace\" title=\"Rigid Milwaukee Brace\">Rigid Milwaukee Brace</a> — shoulders. Later names on that slot are <a href=\"/wiki/Vile_Shoulders\" title=\"Vile Shoulders\">Vile Shoulders</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Chavez's_Shoulders_of_Shattering\" title=\"Chavez's Shoulders of Shattering\">Chavez's Shoulders of Shattering</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/RibSkid_Rebounder\" title=\"RibSkid Rebounder\">RibSkid Rebounder</a> — shield. Nothing replaced that shield name.</li>\n</ul>\n<a name=\"Old_plate\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Old plate</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Foil_Covered_Thinkbox\" title=\"Foil Covered Thinkbox\">Foil Covered Thinkbox</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/20_Cubit_Spinnerz\" title=\"20 Cubit Spinnerz\">20 Cubit Spinnerz</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/New_Fangled_Spangled_Tabard\" title=\"New Fangled Spangled Tabard\">New Fangled Spangled Tabard</a></li>\n</ul>\n<a name=\"Old_shields\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Old shields</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Electric_Fence\" title=\"The Electric Fence\">The Electric Fence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Alfskin_Aegis\" title=\"Alfskin Aegis\">Alfskin Aegis</a></li>\n</ul>\n<a name=\"Old_amulets\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Old amulets</span></h2>\n<p>The later amulet names on those slots are the generated bling pile, starting with <a href=\"/wiki/Phat_Bling\" title=\"Phat Bling\">Phat Bling</a>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mad_Bling\" title=\"Mad Bling\">Mad Bling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Amulet_of_Yawn-Bore\" title=\"Amulet of Yawn-Bore\">Amulet of Yawn-Bore</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
